# Expertise-guarded paths for <YOUR_ORG>/agent-ops — the pipeline's own repo.
# Judged only for loop verification (a planted-defect PR runs judge -> revise
# -> re-judge here so no public repo carries a deliberately broken PR). The
# principle is the same as the product guards: the agent may never edit the
# gates that grade it or the state it runs on.
# One bash glob per line ('*' matches across '/'); full-line comments only.

# CI, personas, schemas, runtime state
.github/**
agents/**
schemas/**
state/**
guards/**

# The scripts that grade, gate, and record agent work
scripts/commit-state.sh
scripts/update-claim.sh
scripts/record-provenance.sh
scripts/expertise-path-guard*
scripts/footprint-scan.sh
scripts/round-history.py
scripts/result-line.sh
scripts/validate-judge-verdict.py
scripts/verify-claims.py

# Rules
CLAUDE.md
